ave been regrouped / rearranged wherever considered necessary to make them comparable with current period fugures.      7. Financial Results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on 10th August' 2023 . The statutory auditors have expressed an unmodified opinion on the aforesaid results.      For &amp; on behalf of the Board   sd/-   Vishal Oswal   Vice-Chairman &amp; Managing Director   DIN : 00002678      Date: 10.08.2023   Place: Ludhiana</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
